  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_EXPANDING_REEL
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXPANDING REEL FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_EXPANDING_REEL
    value: '<size=24>- Individual reel or reels may expand by up to 2 spots during
      reel spin.

      - Depending on reel expansion, number of way wins may vary.

      - Maximum potential reel expansion is 7x5.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_EXTRA_ORCA
    value: <style=title><size=42>EXTRA ORCA FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_EXTRA_ORCA
    value: "<size=24>- 1 extra Orca symbol may be added to the top most symbol position
      \n  on each reel."
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_MULTIPLIER_WILD
    value: <style=title><size=42>MULTIPLIER WILD FEATURE</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_MULTIPLIER_WILD
    value: '<size=24>- Wild symbol appears on reels 2, 3, and 4 only.

      - Wild may randomly award multipliers up to 3x.

      - In Free Games, Wild will always have multipliers between 2x and 4x.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_FREE_GAMES
    value: <style=title><size=42>FREE GAMES</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_FREE_GAMES
    value: '<size=24>- 3 or more Scatter symbols triggers Free Games.

      - In Free Games, 2 or more Scatters awards Additional Free Games.'
  - key: PAYTABLE_WAY_INFO
    value: <size=24><color=#00eaff>1024 WAYS</color></size>
  - key: PAYTABLE_BET_INFO
    value: '<size=24><color=#00eaff>Base Bet: 75</color></size>'
  - key: PAYTABLE_TITLE_JACKPOTS
    value: <style=title><size=42>GRAND & MEGA JACKPOTS</size></style>
  - key: PAYTABLE_DESCRIPTION_JACKPOTS
    value: '<size=24>- Each spin provides the user an opportunity to win the Jackpot.

      - After each spin, either a GRAND or MEGA JACKPOT may be awarded.'
